{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. A backpack is located on the right side of the image. For every remote found in the scene, it is positioned to the left of the backpack, and a wrench is located to the left of the remote. The wrench is placed above a pair of jeans. The jeans are aligned vertically with a game controller, and a pair of scissors is positioned above the game controller.",
